### =========================
### USERS
### =========================

### Create user
POST http://localhost:5000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Onasis",
  "email": "onasis@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}


### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users


### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users/1


### Update user
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Onasis Updated",
  "role": "STAFF"
}


### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/users/1



### =========================
### MENU
### =========================

### Create menu category (if you have category routes)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kabobs",
  "description": "Fresh grilled kabobs"
}


### Get menu
GET http://localhost:5000/api/menu



### =========================
### ORDERS
### =========================

### Create order (guest checkout)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerPhone": "702-555-1234",
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "menuItemId": 3,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}


### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders


